        "id": 13216,
        "name": "Entaku no Seito: The Eternal Legend",
        "summary": "The Playstation Portable port of the PC game \"Entaku no Seito\" with the extra content added from the Xbox 360 release. \n \nIt is a dungeon crawling JRPG featuring a bonding system, a trapping mechanic with the ability to lure enemies, and a rivalry system to fight over treasure. \n \nThis game was later re-released with the name \"Entaku no Seito: The Eternal Legend (Kadokawa Game Collection)\" under the premise that it is a prequel to the game \"Demon Gaze\" as they share the same world although they are hundred of years apart in the story.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co2gx9.jpg",
