        "id": 14680,
        "name": "Star Gladiator Episode I: Final Crusade",
        "summary": "Star Gladiator Episode I: Final Crusade is a 1996 weapon-based 3D fighting game released by Capcom for the PlayStation-based ZN-1 arcade hardware. It was Capcom‍ '​s first polygonal fighting game, preceding the original Street Fighter EX (which Capcom had co-produced with Arika) by a few months\n\nA PlayStation port was released in October 1996. It was followed by a single sequel, Plasma Sword, in 1998.",
