        "summary": "Experience the rush of high-octane street racing in Need for Speed Underground: Rivals. Customize your ride, push it to the limit, and dominate the underground racing scene. Race against fierce competitors and build your reputation as the ultimate street racer. With adrenaline-pumping gameplay and stunning graphics, immerse yourself in the heart-pounding world of urban racing like never before.\n\nCustomize 20 tuner cars and race on 10 new circuit tracks.\n\nEight modes including Drift Attack, and Rally Relay.\n\nTune your ride performance and style.\n\nSpecial Features: Wireless and Party Play Multiplayer Modes\nEA Pocket TRAX Music Visualization Player",
