      {
        "id": 42881,
        "name": "Super Collapse 3",
        "summary": "Super Collapse is back, and you won't believe the fun! The third installment of this highly addictive series boasts more action and surprise than ever before. Adventure awaits as you explore 10 fun and unique lands in the all-new Quest mode.\n\nEarn coins along the way to purchase strategic items in the Shop, or take a breather and try your luck at one of 10 mini-games in the Casino. And for the true Super Collapse aficionado, new variations and classic favorites in our Quick Play mode deliver endless, back-to-back challenges.\n\nExplore the secrets of Collapse world in 140 brand new puzzles!",
