      {
        "id": 43740,
        "name": "Pinball Power",
        "summary": "Pinball Power (referred to as \"Golden Logres\" in-game and Japan) is another pinball simulator by LittleWing. A sequel to both Tristan and Crystal Caliburn, the game features three tables based on the Arthurian legends: Camelot, Land's End and Fisher King. After completing all the missions on one table, the game moves to the next one. A practice mode is available to test the last two tables and prepare to the full game.",
