      {
        "id": 56744,
        "name": "Kidou Senshi Gundam: Senjou No Kizuna Portable",
        "summary": "A port of Senjō no Kizuna, entitled Mobile Suit Gundam: Bonds of the Battlefield Portable was made available for the PlayStation Portable.\n\nFeatures exclusive to the PSP version include \"Mission Mode\", which gives basic tutorials and allows up to three players to accomplish predetermined objectives, and \"Extended Operation Mode\" which pits teams against one another in three consecutive arcade matches. The map can be determined in the beginning, but the latter two mission maps are subject to random selection (or is determined by the losing team if in multiplayer). The winning team will be given a handicap on subsequent missions (units and bases starting with HP damage, reducing frame defense, etc.).",
