        "id": 97875,
        "name": "Pro Mahjong Kiwame Tengensenhen",
        "summary": "Pro Mahjong Kiwame is a four player Riichi mahjong game, unlike most one-on-one Mahjong games released at the time and the modern casual games. Players take and discard tiles until they've completed hands by forming groups and pairs.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/coaat9.jpg",
