      {
        "id": 118918,
        "name": "Championship Manager 2010 Express",
        "summary": "PS Minis Port of Championship Manager 2010 for PS3 abd PSP via the PlayStation Network.\n\nChampionship Manager 2010 Express gives players total control on the move as you manage your favourite teams from around the UK, France and Italy anytime, anywhere. Packed with all the player data, club information and more from the 2009/10 season. Pick from across multiple UK, French and Italian leagues and begin the journey to managerial success.\n\n• Individual Player Training –Hone player skills and prepare them ahead of the big games.\n• 2D Match Engine – See how your team is dealing with the opposition and be ready to tweak your tactics on the fly, or make key substitutions if things aren’t going your way.\n• Full promotion & relegation – With full relegation and promotion across the leagues managers could quickly find themselves heading to non-league football & the sack if they fail to perform.\n• Press Conferences - Face the full glare of the media with post match press conferences and be ready to explain your on pitch actions to the waiting press.",
