        "summary": "Experience the excitement and realism of the world’s most popular sport in FIFA 14 for the PSP. With updated teams, authentic stadiums, and improved gameplay mechanics, FIFA 14 delivers a soccer experience that captures the essence of the beautiful game.\n\nTake control of your favorite teams and players from leagues all over the world. Enjoy enhanced ball physics, refined player animations, and smarter AI that make every match feel unique and challenging. Whether you're playing a quick match, diving into a full season, or managing your team to glory in Career Mode, FIFA 14 offers endless hours of engaging soccer action.\n\nFIFA 14 also features multiplayer modes, allowing you to challenge your friends in head-to-head matches via Ad-Hoc. Hone your skills in Skill Games, and show off your style with new dribbling techniques and goal celebrations.\n\nWith its stunning visuals, authentic audio, and comprehensive gameplay, FIFA 14 for the PSP is the ultimate portable soccer experience. Lace up your boots, step onto the pitch, and lead your team to victory!\n\nThis game only released in North America, in digital format.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co71g9.jpg",
        "release_date": 1379980800,
