      {
        "id": 279207,
        "name": "Pool Academy",
        "summary": "Pool Academy (aka Doukyu Re-Mix Billiard Multiple) is the sequel to Doukyu Billiard Master released for the Pal region.\n\nAgain the objective is to play the best game of pool possible while wagering high amounts of cash. But no matter how good you think you are, there's always someone better than you...or is there?\n\nFancy an evening of playing pool without the smoky atmosphere of a pub with walls too close to the table? Why not try Pool Academy? With 5 game modes including a very fun and addictive trick-shot section, 8 players to compete against and help available from a pro to improve your skills, Pool Academy is all you need to hone your virtual skills.",
