        "summary": "Le Concert is a PlayStation game that puts the player in the role of a young classic orchestra conductor that will go through 5 different stages, beginning with a small orchestra and until a big one. The gameplay is about pressing the proper button in the proper time and if the player do it in the perfect time a number of times the stage is cleared and he can advance to the next one.\n\nBetween the stages a story takes places and the character talk until the next stage begins.\n\nThe game features 2 different game styles gamers mode and musicians mode, and also a listening room that will be unlocked playing the main game. In Le Concert Pianissimo the player control a female character and in Fortissimo a male one.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co8zgm.jpg",
        "release_date": 944697600,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
