        "summary": "The Australian release of Ford Bold Moves Street Racing (EU: Ford Street Racing). The PS2 version replaces some existing cars with Aussie originals, while the PSP version adds these cars in new slots.\n\nIt is completely identical to the original version, but contains 4 additional cars synonymous with the history of Ford in Australia: the 1970 Ford XY GT Falcon, the 1970 Ford XY GTHO Falcon (Phase III), the 2003 Falcon XR8 Ute and the Australian Falcon XR8.",
